From 8052e68da27f7f9e01dabc771fb4664fc70133c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cennac <cennac@163.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 21:19:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] bluetooth: use MB0002 AP6275P reference firmware

The previous 91,900-byte BCM43752A2 firmware identifies its RF module as
Ampak AP6398.  MB0002 carries AP6275P, and runtime tests show working BLE
reception but zero Classic Inquiry results plus HCI page timeouts.

Use the 59,061-byte firmware extracted from the MB0002 vendor reference
system.  It explicitly identifies Ampak AP6275P version 0021.0023.

---
 bluetooth/lib/firmware/BCM4362A2.hcd | Bin 91900 -> 59061 bytes
 1 file changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)

diff --git a/bluetooth/lib/firmware/BCM4362A2.hcd b/bluetooth/lib/firmware/BCM4362A2.hcd
index ab9ba6e1eabd64c38d523f22d8ece39e7d189dbd..bc6dd606c4a1620f55ea85c5690b4d38898b5f0b 100644
GIT binary patch
